    "The caller prepared a private directory and a named pipe. Before each submission the target name was absent. All three submissions used the same request bytes, path operands and controls.",
    "The first action read one byte from the pipe. The caller opened its write end with O_NONBLOCK, retrying ENXIO for at most four seconds. When it connected, the worker had been released for the phase and could proceed past read_fresh only after the caller supplied a byte or closed the writer.",
